# Models are fetched at runtime and checksum-pinned, never vendored.
# 4.7 GB here is the full development manifest, not a user download: a default
# install fetches 642 MiB (Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 plus Silero VAD). The Qwen3
# GGUFs are benchmark-only, since the shipped app has no local LLM.
# Their licences differ from this repo's.
# Ignore the contents, not the directory: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, so a bare "models/" here silently kills the
# negation below.
models/*

# models.lock.json IS tracked: it pins the exact bytes each release was built
# against, so a silently-changed upstream is caught rather than trusted.
!models/models.lock.json

node_modules/
dist/
out/

# Generated test audio: rebuildable, and large.
fixtures/*.wav

# Real meetings used for the counterfactual gate. These are private by
# definition: they are transcripts of actual conversations.
fixtures/meetings/

# Benchmark output is kept as evidence, but not the raw console logs
# or the generated note pairs (which embed meeting content).
results/*.log
results/counterfactual-*/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.local
